<title>USA: Rollins Truck to buy back back shrs.</title>
<headline>Rollins Truck to buy back back shrs.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rollins Truck Leasing Corp said Thursday it plans to buy back up to two million additional shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company said the purchases are to be made from time to time on the open market at prevailing market prices.</p>
<p>Rollins had authorized in October the repurchase of about two million shares, most of which was fulfilled, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>The company now has about 42 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
